<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Team Cup matches played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Red Group</p>
<p>Australia beat United States 2-1</p>
<p>Doubles result (Australian names first) Mark woodforde/Todd Woodbridge beat Alex O'Brien/ Jonathan Stark 4-6 6-4 6-2.</p>
<p>Croatia lead Czech Republic 1-0</p>
<p>Results (Croatian names first): Goran Ivanisevic beat Bohdan Ulihrach 6-4 3-6 6-4</p>
</text>
